    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, just looking at the stack for the Q4 migration. We've got the legacy DB and that new cloud API ready to go. Can we just do a direct integration to hit the go-live date, or is there some compatibility issue we should be worrying about? I really don't want to have to tell the board we need more time or a bigger budget for middleware.",
